    "en": {
      "trackName": "F1BowRace",
      "description": "Step back in time to the golden age of handheld gaming! F1 BowRace brings the authentic nostalgia of 1980s liquid crystal display (LCD) wrist games directly to your Apple Watch. \n\nNo modern distractions—just pure, high-contrast digital segments, rising speeds, and your reflexes against the clock.\n\nFEATURES:\n\n• AUTHENTIC 80s LCD GRAPHICS\nEnjoy a meticulously designed interface mimicking classic Casio and Tiger handheld retro units. Complete with a vintage watch bezel frame, active roadway boundary segments, life counters, speedometer bars, and pixel-accurate formula racing cars.\n\n• DUAL GAME DIFFICULTY MODES\n- Game Mode A (GA-1): The standard arcade setting. Perfect for warming up and practicing your racing lines. Speed increases moderately as your score climbs.\n- Game Mode B (GA-2): The pro challenge. Speed starts high immediately, with a significantly faster ramp-up and tighter obstacle densities.\n\n• INNOVATIVE DIGITAL CROWN STEERING\nSteer like a pro! Rotate your Apple Watch's physical Digital Crown to slide smoothly and react quickly between the left, center, and right lanes. Prefer tactile controls? Tap the left and right halves of your watch screen to steer.\n\n• RETRO AUDIO & ALERTS\nHear the retro buzzer sounds for countdown lights, lane steering clicks, crash warning sound alerts, and game-over sound clips. Completely reacts to your driving action!\n\n• 100% PRIVACY-FOCUSED & OFFLINE\nPlay anywhere—on a flight, on the subway, or offline. F1 BowRace gathers zero data, requires no user accounts, has no ads, and works entirely offline on your wrist. Your high score stays saved locally on your device.\n\nReady to claim the championship? Strap in, rotate the Crown, and beat your personal best on the go!",
